            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Gurwen Ex Miscellanea, That Which Was Shared, Parma Magica Tractatus, Quality 11, Keen-eyed students may notice that it has been glossed in Latin, though of a form more commonly used by mundane academics than by Hermetic magi. (11BP)"
