            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Casagrande of Tremere, A Hermetic Methodology for the Investigation of Occurrences, Intellego Tractatus, Quality 10, A slender volume that makes many references to the widely-known Frosty Breath of the Spoken Lie spell. (10BP)"
